== 2. Parser Function Validation ==

=== Problem Addressed ===
* Missing parameters cause broken rendering
* Invalid values silently accepted
* SMW properties set with malformed data

=== Solution Implemented ===
Multi-layer validation using ParserFunctions:

==== 2.1 Required Field Validation ====

```wiki
{{#if: {{{name|}}}
| <!-- name exists, proceed -->
| <div class="infobox-concept error-box">Error: Missing required parameter name. [[Category:Infobox Concept missing name]]</div>
}}
```

'''Required Fields by Template:'''

| Template | Required Fields |
|----------|-----------------|
| Infobox_Concept | name, definition, epistemic_status, confidence_score |
| Infobox_Idea | name, definition, epistemic_status, confidence_score |
| Infobox_Project | name, description, goal, status, epistemic_status, confidence_score |

==== 2.2 Controlled Vocabulary Validation ====

'''Epistemic Status (all templates):'''
```wiki
{{#switch: {{{epistemic_status}}}
| Hypothetical = <!-- valid -->
| Emerging = <!-- valid -->
| Established = <!-- valid -->
| Verified = <!-- valid -->
| Axiomatic = <!-- valid -->
| #default = <div class="error-box">Error: Invalid epistemic_status...</div>
}}
```

'''Project Status (Infobox_Project only):'''
```wiki
{{#switch: {{{status}}}
| Active = <!-- valid -->
| Completed = <!-- valid -->
| On Hold = <!-- valid -->
| Cancelled = <!-- valid -->
| #default = <div class="error-box">Error: Invalid status...</div>
}}
```

==== 2.3 Range Validation ====

'''Confidence Score (0.0-1.0):'''
```wiki
{{#if: {{{confidence_score|}}}
| {{#ifexpr: {{{confidence_score}}} >= 0 and {{{confidence_score}}} <= 1
| <!-- valid -->
| <div class="error-box">Error: confidence_score must be between 0.0 and 1.0</div>
}}
| <div class="error-box">Error: Missing required parameter confidence_score</div>
}}
```

----
== 3. SMW Property Assignment Guards ==

=== Problem Addressed ===
* SMW properties set even with invalid data
* Silent failures in semantic queries
* Data integrity issues

=== Solution Implemented ===
Nested conditional guards ensure properties only set when ALL validations pass:

```wiki
{{#if: {{{name|}}}
| {{#if: {{{definition|}}}
| {{#if: {{{epistemic_status|}}}
| {{#if: {{{confidence_score|}}}
| {{#ifexpr: {{{confidence_score}}} >= 0 and {{{confidence_score}}} <= 1
| <!-- All validations passed, set SMW properties -->
[[Has entity type::Concept]]
[[Has name::{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}]]
[[Has definition::{{{definition}}}]]
...
| <!-- Invalid confidence score, skip SMW -->
}}
| <!-- Missing confidence_score, skip SMW -->
}}
| <!-- Missing epistemic_status, skip SMW -->
}}
| <!-- Missing definition, skip SMW -->
}}
| <!-- Missing name, skip SMW -->
}}
```

=== Conditional Property Assignment ===

Optional fields use `#if` before setting properties:

```wiki
{{#if: {{{originator|}}}|[[Has originator::{{{originator}}}]]}}
{{#if: {{{origin_date|}}}|[[Has origin date::{{{origin_date}}}]]}}
{{#if: {{{domain|}}}|[[Has domain::{{{domain}}}]]}}
```

