== 4. Error Handling and Categories ==

=== Validation Error Categories ===

Each validation failure adds a tracking category:

| Template | Error Category |
|----------|----------------|
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept missing name |
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept missing definition |
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept missing epistemic status |
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept missing confidence |
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept invalid epistemic status |
| Infobox_Concept | Infobox Concept invalid confidence |
| Infobox_Idea | (same pattern) |
| Infobox_Project | (same pattern + status categories) |

=== Error Display ===

Errors render as visible red boxes with clear messages:

```html
<div class="infobox-concept error-box">
  Error: Missing required parameter name. 
  [Category:Infobox Concept missing name]
</div>
```

