== 5. Graceful Degradation ==

=== Default Values ===

Parameters use pipe syntax for defaults:

```wiki
{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}  <!-- Falls back to page name -->
{{{definition|Not provided}}}  <!-- Shows placeholder text -->
{{{epistemic_status|Unknown}}}  <!-- Shows Unknown -->
```

=== Conditional Rendering ===

Optional sections only render when data exists:

```wiki
{{#if: {{{image|}}}
| <div class="infobox-image">[[File:{{{image}}}...]]</div>
}}
```

