== 6. Migration Guide ==

=== For Template Editors ===

# '''Update existing template calls''' to include all required parameters
# '''Validate epistemic_status''' is one of: Hypothetical, Emerging, Established, Verified, Axiomatic
# '''Validate confidence_score''' is between 0.0 and 1.0
# '''Check error categories''' to find pages needing updates

=== For Template Administrators ===

# '''Upload CSS files''' to corresponding Template:Name/styles.css pages
# '''Enable TemplateStyles extension''' if not already active
# '''Test template output''' on sandbox pages before deployment
# '''Monitor error categories''' for validation failures

=== For Content Migrators ===

# '''Audit existing pages''' using these templates
# '''Add missing required parameters'''
# '''Fix invalid epistemic_status values'''
# '''Normalize confidence_score to 0.0-1.0 range'''

