== 8. Validation Checklist ==

Before deploying templates, verify:
* [ ] All required parameters have validation
* [ ] Controlled vocabularies use `#switch` statements
* [ ] Range validations use `#ifexpr`
* [ ] SMW properties wrapped in conditional guards
* [ ] CSS scoped via TemplateStyles
* [ ] Error categories are trackable
* [ ] Default values prevent empty output
* [ ] Responsive design works on mobile
* [ ] Documentation updated with new parameters

